false,"text":"Since she is easily swayed, she tends to believe what others told her without a single doubt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is loved by both customers and shop manager whenever she visits the shop and is treated like the mascot character, though she prefers to be treated more like a grown-up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives in a single parent family, yet her mother is frequently busy with work, so that causes her to feel lonely."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She calls the protagonist \"papa\" because of an extended playing house period with each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Everyone also loves to call her \"Tama-chan\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22997"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公宅の隣に住んでいるロシア人の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は大人しくもじもじさんだけど朗らか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"押しに弱く、言われたことは疑うことなく信じてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ショップに現れると客や店長に愛でられ、ゆるキャラ扱いされるが本人はオトナ扱いしてほしいお年ごろ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母子家庭且つ母が仕事で忙しい為、寂しい思いをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おままごとの延長から、主人公のことを“ぱぱ”と呼ぶように。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皆には「タマちゃん」と呼ばれ愛でられている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3409","sourceWorkId":"19883","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公宅の隣に住んでいるロシア人の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はおとなしく、もじもじさんだけど朗らか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"押しに弱く、言われたことは疑うことなく信じてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ショップに現れると客や店長に愛でられ、ゆるキャラ扱いされるが、本人はオトナ扱いしてほしいお年ごろ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母子家庭かつ母が仕事で忙しいため、寂しい思いをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おままごとの延長から、主人公のことを “ぱぱ” と呼ぶように。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皆には “タマちゃん” と呼ばれ愛でられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あのねっあのねっ…お、おねしょしたの… ママにはないしょだよ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25315"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25315","value":"ママ、バナナ、うさみん"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"weight":[{"comparisonValue":"29","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22997","value":"29"},{"comparisonValue":"29.3","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25315","value":"29.3kg"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6ea61399bd2b2ced6c08353e76b085e4fb2ecf950f58661221c4a6e1af943250.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f3aa7dac859b6e18e50b1cdee34712bd685ccf3a577bcdc6c7a00c2de58d994f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:94388:25315:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22998","characterName":"双葉 葵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"25316","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"94388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3410"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22998"},"originalCharacterName":"双葉 葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"36"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Loves: Sister Donuts, bunnies"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chest size: seems like developing but actually not"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A little girl running away from home and currently lives outside in the park."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She starred in \"Petit Idol\", appearing on the DVD image with a questionable pose, though the business is currently closed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's whimsical and devilish, something like a cat."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She shows a seemingly mocking behavior to the protagonist, but deep inside she also has a side of loneliness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In return for taking care of her with stuffs like food, bathing and so on, she does some naughty things with the protagonist which gradually turns into a regular routine, and that became somewhat a compensated dating-like relationship."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her catchphrase is \"I'm so done!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although whenever she says that, her true intention is the complete opposite."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has her first period during the course of the story."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22998"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぷち家出中の公園で野宿をしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"きわどい恰好でイメージDVDに出演する、「ぷちアイドル」をしているが休業中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネコのように気まぐれで、小悪魔的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公をからかうような素振りを見せながらも、根は寂しがりの一面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食事やお風呂などを世話してあげる代わりに、ちょっとエッチなことをするのがお決まりになってしまいプチ援交のような関係になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口癖は「絶交だしっ」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし絶交絶交と言いながら本心は真逆の模様。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3410","sourceWorkId":"19883","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぷち家出中の、公園で野宿をしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"きわどい恰好でイメージDVDに出演する “ぷちアイドル” をしているが、休業中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネコのように気まぐれで小悪魔的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公をからかうような素振りを見せながらも、根は寂しがりの一面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食事やお風呂などを世話してあげる代わりに、ちょっとエッチなことをするのがお決まりになってしまい、プチ援交のような関係になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口癖は 「絶交だしっ」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし絶交絶交と言いながら、本心は真逆の模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「すぐ帰ってくるって言ったでしょ！　今度約束破ったら、絶交だしっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25316"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25316","value":"シスドのドーナツ、うさぎ"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/232ec2590722b8aec898117e62000ce9015b2f95e197a16944da0ba502fd077a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/212573300a3417b5c6a79a76cb27af6febbc32f77a2e9f6a1383886f84d4cd76.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:94388:25316:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22999","characterName":"美浦 千景","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"25317","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"94388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3411"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22999"},"originalCharacterName":"美浦 千景","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Loves: cooking, her manager"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chest size: developing"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl working part-time at the Fancy Shop USAMi."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a graceful and mature girl, but becomes super shy and unable to conceal her trembling whenever she is taken by surprise."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Being immensely curious about the lower half of body, she cannot see a man's face directly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She deliberately took off her glasses, moved away from her parents' house to attend a girls' school, all to make her feel more at ease for not having to make eye contact with boys as much as possible."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she was little, she lived next door to the protagonist's house, and she was called as \"Chii-chan\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of her, the protagonist gradually gets used to wearing the bunny head mask, to the point when he even forgets that he's wearing it sometimes."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22999"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファンシーショップ「USAMi」でアルバイトをしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たおやかで大人びているが、不意を突かれると動揺が隠しきれない“恥らいガール”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"下半身に興味津々過ぎてまともに男性の顔が見られない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あえてメガネを外したり、実家から離れた女子校に通っていたり、極力男性と目を合わせないで済むようにしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さいころ主人公の家のとなりに住んでいて、「ちーちゃん」と呼ばれていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がウサギのかぶりものをすることで徐々に慣れていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3411","sourceWorkId":"19883","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファンシーショップ 『USAMi』 でアルバイトをしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たおやかで大人びているが、不意を突かれると動揺が隠しきれない “恥らいガール”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"下半身に興味津々過ぎて、まともに男性の顔が見られない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あえてメガネを外したり、実家から離れた女子校に通っていたり、極力男性と目を合わせないで済むようにしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さいころ主人公の家の隣りに住んでいて、“ちーちゃん” と呼ばれていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がウサギの被りものをすることで徐々に慣れていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あああぁあのあのあの、ごごごめんなさいっ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25317"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25317","value":"お料理、てんちょうさん"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"weight":[{"comparisonValue":"40","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22999","value":"40"},{"comparisonValue":"40.3","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25317","value":"40.3kg"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/facbf798457cc1ab26d2d978c0e752b6d5b14f30745613ab6f43a631f00ee630.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24ff6f2c0b3b64dc7119618f6affcde8e955885e9bb76e94820f87b0b2c307a8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平井まみ","creatorId":"vndb:s939","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s939","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s939","name":"平井 まみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:94388:25317:18547:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23000","characterName":"宇佐美 美々","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"25318","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"94388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3412"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23000"},"originalChara